title: TavernQuestComplete
tags: quests
---
<<if $Tavernquest_status == "started">>
Tavern: Have you been able to get those shiny keys for me?
-> Slimes: Yeah, we got them right here Tavern!
    <<if $Tavernquest_amount < $Tavernquest_count>>
        Tavern: I think you're still missing some keys, you have {$Tavernquest_amount}, there should be {$Tavernquest_count}
    <<elseif $Tavernquest_amount == $Tavernquest_count>>
        <<set $Tavernquest_status = "completed">>
        Tavern: thanks for collecting all those keys for me, I've gathered everyone in the tavern come have a drink!
        <<give_reward QuestGiverTavern>>
    <<endif>>
-> Slimes: Not yet, were still missing some
    Tavern: Come back when you've collected them all!
<<elseif $Tavernquest_status == "completed">>
    Tavern: Thanks for collecting all those keys for me! The taverns open now for a drink!
<<else>>
    Tavern: Damn, you already collected all the keys, nice! Come have a drink in the tavern!
    <<give_reward QuestGiverTavern>>
<<endif>>
===
